#Add below Configuration for restriction 
*attention : Squid processes http_access rules from top to bottom. Once a request matches a rule, Squid stops checking the following rules.
Therefore, specific deny rules must be placed before broad allow rules.

acl aparat dstdomain .aparat.com
http_access deny aparat

systemctl restart squid

